/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4 5]
>>
endobj
667 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Stores essential system binaries used for system administration tasks. These commands often require root privileges, such as `shutdown`, `reboot`, `fdisk`, and `ifconfig`.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 16 0 R
>>
endobj
